<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to all Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/42px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/56px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to all Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li></ul></div>\n</div></section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Conditions</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"conditions\" data-item-name=\"conditions\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sturdy_(Condition)\" title=\"Sturdy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sturdy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sturdy_(Condition)\" title=\"Sturdy (Condition)\"><b>Sturdy</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><ul><li>This material is rather strong. Only a hit that deals at least 10 damage can damage it.</li></ul></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section></aside>\n<b>Attuned Crystals</b> are environmental objects found in the cave with <a href=\"/wiki/Ansur\" title=\"Ansur\">Ansur</a>. \n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>They can be used as cover from Ansur's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stormheart_Nova\" title=\"Stormheart Nova\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/25px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/38px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/50px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stormheart Nova\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/25px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stormheart_Nova\" title=\"Stormheart Nova\">Stormheart Nova</a>. When broken, they apply <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crystal_Skin_(Condition)\" title=\"Crystal Skin (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crystal Skin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Crystal_Skin_(Condition)\" title=\"Crystal Skin (Condition)\">Crystal Skin</a> to creatures within 3 m (10 ft).\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crystal_Skin_(Condition)\" title=\"Crystal Skin (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crystal Skin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Crystal_Skin_(Condition)\" title=\"Crystal Skin (Condition)\">Crystal Skin</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 3  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has <a href=\"/wiki/Resistances\" title=\"Resistances\">Resistance</a> to all elemental damage.<sup><i>[<a href=\"/wiki/Crystal_Skin_(Condition)#Bugs\" title=\"Crystal Skin (Condition)\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup></li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715025142\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.130 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.136 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5151/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 45238/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18357/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 11773/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.034/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1077577/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  128.302      1 -total\n 85.50%  109.702      1 Template:Infobox_creature\n 58.47%   75.019      1 Template:Infobox_creature/internal\n 24.08%   30.895      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  8.43%   10.813      1 Template:Template_style\n  8.15%   10.456     33 Template:Trim\n  6.70%    8.598      4 Template:Icon_link\n  6.24%    8.001      4 Template:Icon_text\n  5.22%    6.701      1 Template:Condition\n  4.94%    6.343     52 Template:Plus_if_pos\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:47651-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715025142 and revision id 400124. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}